      {
        "author_name": "Vikramjit Singh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115155171093147720517/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXU9dcLe80dfZWHkOlPkeyHd4qFe3UXlurLyWlf1rjBVi_QVLwVwg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Its a pool hall. Old place, so dont expect much. Has quite a few tables. Has a bar. Easy place to hangout with friends.",
        "time": 1767797030,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Natacha G. Filion",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102990330563976867846/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVGdpcYcgDNuK0ugzbCny_hwNhxzG6VHiAhN5c4NJNZeQbUUYdA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "It's a cool spot if you like playing pool.\n\nThe bathrooms are gross and that's why it lost a star.\n\nSeriously, like before the lockdown a year and a half ago there was a garbage bag covering one of the stalls.\n\nThe only working toilet still is not flushing. The stall doesn't lock properly and the dim lighting over the graffiti makes it look like one of those alleyways where homeless people hang out...Actually, I would feel slightly less grossed out next to a dumpster in an alley.",
        "time": 1627333331,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kang Movers",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109201507330105943169/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXP5rQj097QgVRL6KMdbQTrF2ZkyFaFpMqYaqfyROyxo4c2edOQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "5 star for the location- On the highway for a quick detour, lots of parking in the side, lake in the back, a lot of tables and good bar service",
        "time": 1710715823,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Holly",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113264094417138186602/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWfV7xfBkhrVgqf_nWOnhEbbATA7buT8wKExtIcy1HuHFoAcKvRYQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "A little rough around the edges but has straight pool cues and plenty of tables.  Dart board, various music selection, friendly staff.",
        "time": 1685364662,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sg1",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113252521247868411165/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2nf7ALZDHfD01Me3usxdJBYdgnLqkwxuDNeud8osxLsZzyp5u=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "As of\nFebruary 4 th 2025 it is closed down there's nothing left inside the building. The new place is using old photographs of the old place as the new business I don't know why they're doing that they should remove all the old photos for the new place",
